---
title: Tool approval lifecycle
---
%% Source of truth: packages/harness/src/felix/approvals/store.py (find_approved, create_pending,
%% decide, close_timed_out, close_interrupted, consume_approval) and approvals/interrupt.py.
stateDiagram-v2
    accTitle: States a tool-call approval moves through
    accDescr: When a manifest's approval rule matches a tool call, the wrapper looks for an existing approved grant for the same call signature, a hash of its arguments, before creating anything; a grant marked one_shot is searched with unconsumed_only, so it authorises exactly one call. With no grant, create_pending writes a pending row, or reuses a live pending row for the same signature, and the run waits on it. A row is only ever pending, approved or denied. A person approves, optionally with edited arguments that the tool then runs with, or denies. Nobody answering is also a denial: when the deadline passes, the harness closes the row as denied with the note timeout, or interrupted when the run was cut short, and the model is told the call was refused. An approved grant is reused by identical calls until its expires_at, after which it stops matching and the next identical call asks again. Spending a one_shot grant is a single conditional UPDATE, so two concurrent identical calls cannot both spend it.

    [*] --> Matched : approval rule matches the tool call
    Matched --> Approved : find_approved returns a live grant for the signature
    Matched --> Pending : no grant, create_pending writes or reuses a row

    Pending --> Approved : a person approves, optionally with edited_args
    Pending --> Denied : a person denies
    Pending --> Denied : deadline passes, closed by felix with note timeout or interrupted

    Approved --> Approved : identical calls reuse the grant until expires_at
    Approved --> Spent : one_shot, consume_approval sets consumed_at
    Approved --> Lapsed : expires_at passes

    Spent --> [*] : the tool ran once
    Denied --> [*] : the tool is refused, the model sees [approval note]
    Lapsed --> [*] : the row stays approved but no longer matches, the next call asks again

    note right of Pending
        The run waits here, and so
        does the tool. Not answering
        is answering: it becomes a
        denial at the deadline.
    end note
